      "name": "Configurable Stim Uses",
      "slug": "configurable-stim-uses",
      "teaser": "Configure the amount of uses of stims. That's it.",
      "thumbnail": "",
      "downloads": 2982,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Configure the amount of uses stims have with a config file.</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>Without editing the config this mod will change nothing</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>\n<p>To change stim uses:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open SPT\\user\\mods\\ConfigurableStimUses\\config\\config.json</li>\n<li>Edit <em><strong>“uses”</strong></em> to desire amount</li>\n<li>Save the file</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download</li>\n<li>Extract zip to SPT root</li>\n<li>Probably put at bottom of load order</li>\n</ol>\n<p>s/o to Chomp for mod examples</p>\n",
